organizations that are out there that

02:41:02.330 --> 02:41:07.971
are helping our wounded warriors
specifically with post-traumatic stress

02:41:07.971 --> 02:41:11.240
and traumatic brain injuries one of the
things I've started doing a lot of

02:41:11.240 --> 02:41:15.771
research and what we're beginning to
understand is I used to think that if we

02:41:15.771 --> 02:41:20.690
could help guys find a new purpose after
they got out it would help solve their

02:41:20.690 --> 02:41:25.400
problems wounded warriors but what we're
beginning to understand is that we have

02:41:25.400 --> 02:41:30.800
never the way we train down the way we
have fought wars is exposing guys

02:41:30.800 --> 02:41:35.660
especially in front-line combat units
and special operational operation units

02:41:35.660 --> 02:41:42.380
to level of blast that we've never in in
