these blasts so we need more research we

02:42:10.400 --> 02:42:14.300
need you know we need more non
pharmacological solutions to these

02:42:14.300 --> 02:42:17.780
problems and there's a lot of things
that are out there that are on the

02:42:17.780 --> 02:42:21.740
forefront so one of the things with
research I started doing some stuff with

02:42:21.740 --> 02:42:25.580
the concussion Legacy Foundation which
