to realize that some of our special
operations guys like Rob guzo who took

02:42:35.990 --> 02:42:39.860
his life
severe CTE but what they figured out is

02:42:39.860 --> 02:42:43.580
it's different some of the premium and
premier neurologists that are out there

02:42:43.580 --> 02:42:49.130
figuring out it's different it's it's
blast and the blast goes all the way

02:42:49.130 --> 02:42:52.700
through the brain as opposed to a
concussion that creates an impact and

